[*]"I don't see Lydia anymore, did she die? Can you teleport her corpse to me and resurrect her?"[/*]
[*]"Kill all the draugr in this room but leave the Dragon Priest for me."[/*]
[*]"This music is stuck in a loop — is it tied to a quest? Can you fix it or change the song?"[/*]
[*]"What SKSE plugins do I have installed, and what can you do with them?"[/*]
